{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026zAhxpTXBmv1794451670.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朱千雪（Tracy）與丈夫吳昆倫（Justin）於2019年拉埋天窗，並於2024年迎來大仔誕生，家庭生活一直相當美滿。昨日（11日），朱千雪在社交平台驚喜宣布順利誕下第二胎，同時分享新生BB的近照向大家報喜，並簡單留言寫道：「Parents again」，旋即引來大批圈中好友及網民湧入留言送上祝福。</p><p></p><p>從朱千雪公開的照片中所見，剛出生的BB身穿淺粉色包巾，正閉眼甜美熟睡，側臉輪廓相當可愛，身旁還放有向日葵針織公仔陪伴在側，整體畫面既溫馨又有愛。喜訊公布後，圈中好友及大批網民紛紛留言道賀，恭喜兩公婆正式升呢成為幸福的四口之家！</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f68f6e3f-abe4-45ed-8e15-12ffb3060950.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026UG9Rs0eDs81794451670.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"584ae9fa-1756-4a60-b3cd-faf002481494.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026KoeoIgqFdy1794451669.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.082450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:37:11.399802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:16.286331+00:00","content_hash":"21c94171ad41cb7a913e2ca598abc9d6be6b4f1621ee99e790e03ae2b76bdd41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.082450+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}